{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n鄭裕玲Do姐入行接近50年，主持過無數個大型活動，堪稱香港金牌司儀之一。日前，就有網民翻出Do姐過去在香港小姐決賽和台慶夜串爆兩位港姐冠軍出身的陳凱琳和麥明詩的舊片，網民都紛紛大讚Do姐串得好，睇得非常痛快！\n</p>\n<h2>麥明詩咄咄逼人 嚇親台上港姐</h2>\n<p>其中第一條片段就是Do姐、麥明詩和馮盈盈在《2018年香港小姐競選》泳衣問答環節的片段。當時因為11號佳麗李明芙修讀「社會公益教育學系」，所以麥明詩就「公義」範疇提問，問到「除咗你之外，今晚有邊個佳麗贏咗你覺得係唔公平嘅？唔准講自己喎。」11號佳麗就被嚇到答不出任何名字，只是不斷苦笑。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/pxcmxm0slv-zvilxpyrxvyk6axytn-fwy37esmt-xi_849187684672e0d75e15fc.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"鄭裕玲 do姐 當時11號佳麗嚇到乜都講唔出。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"360\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/pxcmxm0slv-zvilxpyrxvyk6axytn-fwy37esmt-xi_849187684672e0d75e15fc.jpg\" width=\"640\"/></a><figcaption>當時11號佳麗嚇到乜都講唔出。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>麥明詩投訴「唔公平」 Do姐一句型爆反擊</h2>\n<p>Do姐見狀即刻開口圓場，指「可以答冇嘅，唔使俾人逼嘅」，不過麥明詩就表示：「哎呀，Do姐咁nice嘅，我覺得唔公平呀，我選嗰時Do姐冇咁」Do姐當然唔忍，隨即型爆反擊：「咁你都選到啦！你仲想點樣啊？你係香港小姐嚟㗎嘛，點樣唔公平啊？」全場即刻拍掌支持Do姐，另一主持馮盈盈亦見狀圓場：「我哋好收聲喇，如果唔係就話我哋對呢位佳麗唔公平㗎喇」，才成功結束這場問答。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/q33h3dhrcpnfvwx11gdpawpiv7zfr00ylta1by0wnw8_352406224672e0d4ce3844.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"鄭裕玲 do姐 Do姐聽到麥明詩話自己唔公平，即刻開口反駁，型到爆！（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"360\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/q33h3dhrcpnfvwx11gdpawpiv7zfr00ylta1by0wnw8_352406224672e0d4ce3844.jpg\" width=\"640\"/></a><figcaption>Do姐聽到麥明詩話自己唔公平，即刻開口反駁，型到爆！（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/oovcwedpmeslb_u3zbaqvcvq80epl5s7wcq2jsakniy_1291676191672e0d4c09c48.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"鄭裕玲 do姐 麥明詩俾Do姐串完都冇聲出，要身旁的馮盈盈幫忙圓場。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"360\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/oovcwedpmeslb_u3zbaqvcvq80epl5s7wcq2jsakniy_1291676191672e0d4c09c48.jpg\" width=\"640\"/></a><figcaption>麥明詩俾Do姐串完都冇聲出，要身旁的馮盈盈幫忙圓場。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>台慶騷陳凱琳錯講嘢 Do姐一句隔山打牛</h2>\n<p>另一片段則為陳凱琳在《萬千星輝賀台慶2016》主持時講錯嘢，將「奮不顧身」講成「粉身碎骨」：「TVB每一個藝員都係粉身碎骨，務求就係令大家開心」，搞到身邊的陳百祥都忍唔住望一眼。</p>\n<p>事後到Do姐出場時，Do姐憑藉對丁子朗的一句「忠告」隔山打牛，令全場拍爛手掌：「子朗，我身為前輩我俾少少忠告你，就係我哋做藝員，一定要對觀眾負責。如果唔係，明明係奮不顧身，都會變成粉身碎骨。」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/tvb-2016.11.19-0-6-screenshot_316806552672e0cb5869ee.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"鄭裕玲 do姐 陳凱琳在主持期間將「奮不顧身」講成「粉身碎骨」（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"360\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/tvb-2016.11.19-0-6-screenshot_316806552672e0cb5869ee.jpg\" width=\"640\"/></a><figcaption>陳凱琳在主持期間將「奮不顧身」講成「粉身碎骨」（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/tvb-2016.11.19-0-24-screenshot_1246213374672e0cb35d684.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"鄭裕玲 do姐 搞到Do姐都忍唔住之後串翻陳凱琳。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"360\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/tvb-2016.11.19-0-24-screenshot_1246213374672e0cb35d684.jpg\" width=\"640\"/></a><figcaption>搞到Do姐都忍唔住之後串翻陳凱琳。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>網民留言大讚Do姐主持功力：世一主持</h2>\n<p>隨著兩段舊片翻Hit，不少網民都紛紛留言大讚Do姐主持功力，亦有網民批評麥明詩和陳凱琳功力，同Do姐相比依然相差幾條街：「世一主持」、「Do姐貴都係有佢既價值」、「Do姐到現在仲未有司儀可以代替」、「麥明詩今次做乜啊，平時覺得你好地地㗎，做咩咄咄逼人啊」、「可惜過氣大台已失去Do姐」、「do姐主持功力就係勁在 能夠兜完場得嚟又串得靚」等。</p>\n<figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/kakaotalk_20241108_211236711_03_813964697672e0c8dcd2f3-1024x688.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：網民留言截圖）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"639\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/kakaotalk_20241108_211236711_03_813964697672e0c8dcd2f3-1024x688.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n                （圖片來源：網民留言截圖）\n            </figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/kakaotalk_20241108_211236711_04_510597633672e0c8f9b934-1024x713.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：網民留言截圖）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"639\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/kakaotalk_20241108_211236711_04_510597633672e0c8f9b934-1024x713.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n                （圖片來源：網民留言截圖）\n            </figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/kakaotalk_20241108_211236711_05_1504242878672e0c92a050e-1024x722.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：網民留言截圖）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"639\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/kakaotalk_20241108_211236711_05_1504242878672e0c92a050e-1024x722.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n                （圖片來源：網民留言截圖）\n            </figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/kakaotalk_20241108_211236711_06_2062054751672e0c991396b-1024x722.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：網民留言截圖）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"639\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/kakaotalk_20241108_211236711_06_2062054751672e0c991396b-1024x722.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n                （圖片來源：網民留言截圖）\n            </figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/kakaotalk_20241108_211236711_07_838774450672e0c9b9d0c9-1024x810.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：網民留言截圖）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"639\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/kakaotalk_20241108_211236711_07_838774450672e0c9b9d0c9-1024x810.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n                （圖片來源：網民留言截圖）\n            </figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/kakaotalk_20241108_211236711_08_119818140672e0c9dbe774.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：網民留言截圖）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"639\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/kakaotalk_20241108_211236711_08_119818140672e0c9dbe774.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n                （圖片來源：網民留言截圖）\n            </figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/kakaotalk_20241108_211236711_01_222864313672e0c9f58c9b-1024x649.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：網民留言截圖）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"639\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/kakaotalk_20241108_211236711_01_222864313672e0c9f58c9b-1024x649.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n                （圖片來源：網民留言截圖）\n            </figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/kakaotalk_20241108_211236711_02_1174856141672e0ca0cf3de-1024x426.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：網民留言截圖）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"639\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/kakaotalk_20241108_211236711_02_1174856141672e0ca0cf3de-1024x426.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n                （圖片來源：網民留言截圖）\n            </figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T05:02:20.977455+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1350,"images":13,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T04:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T05:38:56.754370+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T04:58:59.127730+00:00","content_hash":"fbf4a5675041d2a707c3a415a1c227da2fbe9857320662423402eb1a4db9e70c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}